url: "https://the-hussite-field-armies.netlify.app/"
abstract: >-
  A documentary apparatus for the Hussite field armies, 1420-1434, built
  from public-domain editions with the original beside an English
  translation, every excerpt read against the page images: Jan Zizka's
  military ordinance of 1423 (Toman 1898, Lutzow 1914); the Empire's war
  and wagon orders of 1426-1429 (Toman 1898); Laurence of Brezova's Prague
  chronicle for 1420-1421, the Latin song on the victory at Domazlice and
  Bartosek of Drahonice on Malesov and Lipany (Fontes rerum Bohemicarum V,
  1893); Martin V's crusade bull of 1421 (Palacky 1873); the Prague Compacts
  with the Council of Basel, 1433 (Archiv cesky III, 1844); and Andreas of
  Regensburg on the raids and Hiltersried (Leidinger 1903). With a
  timeline, a Compare page on seventeen questions, plates, and a list of
  what is not carried and why. Companion game: Radne poslusenstvi.
keywords:
